--- proxy2( prefix, *args )

Almost the same like [[m:XMLRPC::Client#proxy]] only that a call on the returned
XMLRPC::Client::Proxy object behaves like [[m:XMLRPC::Client#call2]], i.e.
a call on that object will return two parameters.

